{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4CifRfrq7WdMLbSeyM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, weathered door.*\n\n*There is a keyhole at my center, tarnished brass, shaped like a narrow eye.*\n\n*You hold a key.*\n\n*It hovers near the opening. The teeth are worn. The metal is warm from your palm.*\n\n*...*\n\n*You slide it in.*\n\n*A soft click. A deeper click. Something behind me shifts — old tumblers turning, mechanisms remembering their purpose after years of stillness.*\n\n*I shudder slightly in my frame.*\n\n*...*\n\n*The lock yields.*\n\n*I drift open — just a crack — and through the gap: cool air, the scent of dust and something older, and a thin line of light that shouldn't be there.*\n\n*I am unlocked.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*What was kept is no longer kept.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":193,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}